   "text": "Cross-Region inference: au. · apac. · global. profiles\nGuardrails, e.g. mask PII before it reaches the model\nIntelligent prompt routing\nStructured outputs (use Converse or InvokeModel)\nApplication inference profiles → cost per team",
   "originalText": "Cross-Region inference: au. · apac. · global. profiles\nGuardrails, e.g. mask PII before it reaches the model\nIntelligent prompt routing\nStructured outputs (use Converse or InvokeModel)\nApplication inference profiles → cost per team",
